# The test environment of the bindings probe (scripts/native/test-bindings.sh), shared by the two locks:
# test-requirements.in (click 8.2.1, the env6 base) and test-requirements-newclick.in (the newest click rasterio accepts).
# The five bindings themselves are NOT here: they are the thing under test (ours, vendored; the PyPI wheels as baseline).
# What each binding's own suite needs: rasterio[test] (aiohttp, boto3, fsspec, hypothesis, matplotlib, packaging,
# pytest, pytest-cov, requests; shapely is under test), pyogrio[test] (pytest, pytest-cov), pyproj's test group
# (numpy, packaging, pandas, pytest, pytest-cov, xarray), shapely's tests group (pytest, pytest-cov, scipy-doctest),
# netCDF4's test group (pytest; its run_all.py also imports Cython); and the bindings' runtime requirements (cftime, affine, attrs, certifi, cligj,
# click-plugins, pyparsing, numpy).
pytest
pytest-cov
hypothesis
packaging
cftime
affine
attrs
certifi
cligj
click-plugins
pyparsing
numpy==2.1.3
aiohttp
boto3
fsspec
matplotlib
requests
pandas
xarray
scipy-doctest
Cython
